       01 BAL      PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE -1234.50.
       01 ED-CR    PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99CR.
       01 ED-MINUS PIC -ZZ,ZZ9.99.
       01 ED-PLUS  PIC +ZZ,ZZ9.99.

